{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_925.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"dd5686ad643dd0268fc443747f320611f557722a64916c9f9caee6ac45484064","ja":"『みなさんが恋愛で重視したい点はなんですか？』\nだってさ！　ヒューヒュー、恋バナじゃーん！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_925.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"f25a8b811dcfda9ab4f5d5dec9886dd267c28925529cba8db99aef3a22500648","ja":"そうね。私は……自然体でいられる相手がいいわね。\nプライベートまで無理してたら、疲れちゃうもの。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_925.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"49ce303c535c3271c544077c807f738b848972f546605eb57410886e500b4124","ja":"わあ、大人な意見……。\nやっぱり経験が違いますね！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_925.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"8689101feb9968e9601ec8cefe8a52dfed256dbac67e1ea1077b23275c069c79","ja":"え？　そ、そうかしら！\nそれじゃあ、琴葉ちゃんの意見も聞かせて？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_925.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4faeb5d192598fa226cf72f2bc4963393444fd40a3c37c68c65b8b40912fc947","ja":"私は、莉緒さんの言うことも大事だと思います。\nでも、ちゃんと自分をみてくれる人がいい……かな。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_925.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"d61aefb7a3473019e4b0d80d01e01952258d361401adf124f09e34fb01fced7a","ja":"……あ、あくまでも想像の話ですけどね！\nえっと、真美ちゃんと雪歩ちゃんはどうかな？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_925.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"4d9c427376965dbfb7786e86ca81d55608ff25d3535c5b2bdd2bff81bcec35d1","ja":"真美は、一緒にゲームしてくれる人がいいかなー！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_925.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"bc468176aedd22700364fd38aef5ace0eda10c9f77f90e82412d823f6f66df9f","ja":"私は、あまり考えたことないかも。\nそれに男の人が苦手だから、そもそも恋愛なんて……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_925.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"53716a146d77c255bedb73982577a48762289fd56f90b92ce1a63f92c71ca962","ja":"そうだよね……。私みたいなダメダメな子が\nきちんと恋愛できるなんて思うのが間違いで……！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_925.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"ed5dd85fc21ff260cbbd71a2ff4d943cd4af1aac667eafe2cba8b31d6188a037","ja":"わーっ！　ゆきぴょん、無理に答えなくて\nいいから！　とりあえず落ち着いて～っ！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
